                                        "title": "September 2025",
                                        "content": "<p>The following is a summary of new and noteworthy updates to the Acme platform for the month of September 2025.</p><h4><b>Features</b></h4><p><b>✨ Acme AI Assistant </b>– Easily search your communications data using natural language! <a href=\"https://edit.me\" target=\"_self\">Read more.</a></p><h4><b>Bug fixes</b></h4><ul><li><p>Fixed several minor visual bugs.</p></li><li><p>Updated microcopy in Compliance &gt; Rule management.</p></li><li><p>Improved knowledge base guide about Discovery</p></li></ul>"
